# Staging copy of the text-generation model, kept only to be uploaded to a
# Hugging Face repo (see docs/huggingface-model-upload.md). Never committed:
# the two ONNX files are 118MB and 182MB, and GitHub hard-rejects files over
# 100MB. The app itself downloads these from the Hub at runtime, so nothing
# here is needed to build or run the project.
